{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund free tram travel for youth aged 11-18",
        "additional_details": "We feel that the price of trams today is extortionate and isn't realistic for those who get it everyday to get to and from places of education to afford. It isn't right for students and young people, and their parents, who can't afford continuous tram tickets to have to pay.",
        "background": "We believe the Government should make tram travel entirely free for youth aged 11-18. Many can't work, because they are in full time education or are too young. ",
